      "writtenOn": "2019-07-23T06:23:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack, but I am not sure: are we going to pack and align this internal structure?  (if we don\u0027t specify any GCC attribute)",
      "parentUuid": "85c10d2a_595efbc7",
      "revId": "a9466647f5c128f3ca3b2356ed9cf20dd57e0aa2",
