      "writtenOn": "2019-07-25T00:12:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just look at pahole output. (sudo emerge dwarves after a repo sync)\n\nI first had to split out the struct (else pahole doesn\u0027t work):\nstruct shm {\n\tuint8_t cap;\n\tuint8_t type;\n\tuintptr_t addr;\n\tuint32_t len;\n};\n\nstatic struct shm shms[EC_CODEC_SHM_ID_LAST];\n\npahole -C shm build/kukui_scp/RW/common/audio_codec.o\n\nNow we have:\nstruct shm {\n        uint8_t                    cap;                  /*     0     1 */\n        uint8_t                    type;                 /*     1     1 */\n\n        /* XXX 2 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n        uintptr_t                  addr;                 /*     4     4 */\n        uint32_t                   len;                  /*     8     4 */\n\n        /* size: 12, cachelines: 1, members: 4 */\n        /* sum members: 10, holes: 1, sum holes: 2 */\n        /* last cacheline: 12 bytes */\n};\n\nstruct shm {\n        uint8_t                    cap;                  /*     0     1 */\n\n        /* XXX 3 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n        uintptr_t                  addr;                 /*     4     4 */\n        uint32_t                   len;                  /*     8     4 */\n        uint8_t                    type;                 /*    12     1 */\n\n        /* size: 16, cachelines: 1, members: 4 */\n        /* sum members: 10, holes: 1, sum holes: 3 */\n        /* padding: 3 */\n        /* last cacheline: 16 bytes */\n};\n\nWe save 4 bytes * EC_CODEC_SHM_ID_LAST.\n\nThen read this: http://www.catb.org/esr/structure-packing/",
      "parentUuid": "6fec2f09_2a9a187e",
      "revId": "a9466647f5c128f3ca3b2356ed9cf20dd57e0aa2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
